  "title": "recent player list would be nice, so say you were in a lobby but either somebody left or you/lobby crashes (it happens still here and there) but you forgot to add an individual you got along with really well, as it is if that happens it's kind of oh well never see them again most times, but if we had a page in menu for recently met users you could scroll through find them and add as a friend or say you were crashed by a user because they still exist even now, you could scroll that page to find the profile and place your moderation report against them for their unwholesome activity. I feel something like that would be nice to have in the social tab.",
